Quebec's new premiere unveiled $28 million in emergency funding to tackle homelessness

00:05:04.401 --> 00:05:06.781
as winter nears, CBC reports.

00:05:07.301 --> 00:05:11.401
Prime Minister Mark Carney says Canada can wait for another administration if necessary

00:05:11.401 --> 00:05:13.861
