00:05:14.481 --> 00:05:19.441
On Sunday, two of three races in the by-national race will send runners across the U.S.-Mexico

00:05:19.441 --> 00:05:24.761
border by a dedicated lane at the San Isidro L. Chaparral checkpoint, which Mexico news daily

00:05:24.761 --> 00:05:27.401
