00:05:27.401 --> 00:05:32.361
year. Intense rainfall flooded rivers in the four corners, where towns declared evacuations

00:05:32.361 --> 00:05:37.541
and emergencies and made rescues, with more rain expected through the weekend, NPR reports.

00:05:38.201 --> 00:05:42.361
A U.S. immigration lawyer says his Canadian client died after she did not seek medical

00:05:42.361 --> 00:05:46.321
care because she feared U.S. authorities would detain and deport her if she crossed through

00:05:46.321 --> 00:05:51.801
British Columbia. Global news reports. A day after officials said the deadly fire at CFB

00:05:51.801 --> 00:05:56.061
Wayne Wright started on an automatic grenade launcher range. Global news reports that

00:05:56.061 --> 00:06:00.341
Corporal Liam Keane, a military medic, was critically injured there, and that his

00:06:00.341 --> 00:06:04.441
mother says he kept running into the fire to save fellow soldiers until his own injuries

00:06:04.441 --> 00:06:05.221
overtook him.

00:06:05.641 --> 00:06:09.701
The Globe and Mail reports that David E.B. surprised British Columbia election is

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:14.161
culminating in a narrow race between the NDP and the conservatives, and that the timing

00:06:14.161 --> 00:06:16.781
of his decision to call it has been a frequent issue for him.

00:06:17.221 --> 00:06:22.221
In the final stretch of the U.S. midterms, researchers who track online influence operations say

00:06:22.221 --> 00:06:26.321
A Kremlin-backed groups are renewing tactics they have used to sow distrust and discord

00:06:26.321 --> 00:06:30.481
in previous elections in the United States and around the world, NPR reports.

00:06:31.418 --> 00:06:35.998
Canada is at this year's United Nations Nature Summit in Armenia, CBC reports,

00:06:36.478 --> 00:06:39.458
